I go to the office every morning.
I am walking towards the bus stop now.
My bus stop is near the house.
I travel by BEST bus every day.
Many people are standing at the stop.
They are all waiting for the bus.
I am standing in a short line.
I am also waiting for my bus.
A man is reading a newspaper.
A woman is talking on the phone.
Morning is a rushed time.
Many vehicles are running on the road.
Now a red bus is coming.
But that is not my bus.
Some people are getting on that bus.
That bus is going ahead.
After ten minutes, my bus arrives.
It is stopping near the stop.
I am moving forward in the line.
I am getting on my bus now.
